# .ydk deck loading: both players use tests/decks/test_basic.ydk (40 main, 2 extra,
# 2 side). The battle module shuffles the main deck from the seed; the core draws
# 5 each. The exact opening hand below is the golden result for this seed.

seed 20261002 7 8 9
deck 0 tests/decks/test_basic.ydk
deck 1 tests/decks/test_basic.ydk

expect count 0 hand 5
expect count 0 deck 35
expect count 0 extra 2       # side deck is not part of the duel
expect count 1 hand 5
expect count 1 deck 35
# Unshuffled, the hand would be the file's last five (3 Luster Dragon, 2 Giant Soldier).
expect cards 0 hand 15025844 13039848 6368038 24068492 24068492
expect cards 1 hand 15025844 70781052 97590747 89631139 83764718
0 idle end
expect count 1 hand 6        # p1 drew for turn 2
expect count 1 deck 34
stop
